  "title": "Search VailVacay listings"
 },
 "description": "Search VailVacay's curated directory of Vail, Colorado businesses (hotels and lodging, restaurants, bars and apr\u00e8s-ski, activities, ski shops, shopping, services and spas). Read-only. Filters: keyword, category, area/neighborhood, price tier, amenities (e.g. ski_in_ski_out, walk_to_lifts, hot_tub, pool, pet_friendly), tag, and distance from a lat/lng or from another listing. Returns compact plain-text listings (description shortened; use get_listing for the full text, hours and FAQ) with the listing page URL, address, phone, website, up to 2 credited photos, and booking links. Booking links are the path to book with the named provider (Expedia for hotels, plus Viator/Klook where the listing has one), not ads; those marked affiliate:true are affiliate links, and VailVacay may earn a commission if the user books, at no extra cost to them. Results are not ranked by commission. Pass check_in/check_out to get date-specific Expedia hotel links (live rates are shown on Expedia, not in this result).",
